00:10:02,127 --> 00:10:04,546
but the practice is still around.

292
00:10:04,783 --> 00:10:06,722
And the stores have a weapon of

293
00:10:06,722 --> 00:10:07,713
their own.

294
00:10:07,713 --> 00:10:09,283
Store brands.

295
00:10:09,363 --> 00:10:12,000
According to the private label industry's

296
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:12,638
trade group,

297
00:10:12,638 --> 00:10:14,176
they made up twenty-one point three

298
00:10:14,176 --> 00:10:17,034
percent of grocery dollar sales in twenty

299
00:10:17,034 --> 00:10:18,293
twenty-five.

300
00:10:18,553 --> 00:10:20,666
When the store makes its own cereal,

301
00:10:20,666 --> 00:10:22,588
it competes with the brands on its

302
00:10:22,588 --> 00:10:23,828
