303
00:10:24,083 --> 00:10:26,213
Let me draw the funnel.

304
00:10:26,463 --> 00:10:27,546
At the top,

305
00:10:27,546 --> 00:10:29,813
many farms and ranches.

306
00:10:29,813 --> 00:10:30,829
In the middle,

307
00:10:30,829 --> 00:10:32,543
