315
00:10:46,967 --> 00:10:48,927
It is not one villain.

316
00:10:48,957 --> 00:10:51,637
The farmer gets about twelve cents.

317
00:10:51,637 --> 00:10:54,077
The store keeps a couple of pennies.

318
00:10:54,087 --> 00:10:56,754
Most of your money pays for everything

319
00:10:56,754 --> 00:10:57,699
in between,

320
00:10:57,699 --> 00:10:58,887
the processing,

321
00:10:58,887 --> 00:10:59,590
the trucks,

322
00:10:59,590 --> 00:11:01,887
the shelves and the people.

323
00:11:02,067 --> 00:11:04,005
Some of the biggest jumps came when

324
00:11:04,005 --> 00:11:06,162
