325
00:11:06,162 --> 00:11:07,858
like a flock of hens or a

326
00:11:07,858 --> 00:11:09,427
herd of cattle.

327
00:11:09,747 --> 00:11:11,967
The real question is how much power

328
00:11:11,967 --> 00:11:13,941
